Features
────────
  Using the everything preset.
  No UI components, per the command line.

Architecture
────────────
  1. Compact
     One module per feature and per data source. Simple, and what most apps
     need.
  2. Modular
     Each feature and data module split into :api and :impl, for larger
     teams.

  Which [1]: 
